      <p begin="02:37.150" end="02:40.390" ttm:agent="v1">덩기덕 쿵더러러 (얼쑤)</p>

      <p begin="02:40.390" end="02:41.890" ttm:agent="v1">Oh-oh, ooh-whoa (hey)</p>

      <p begin="02:41.730" end="02:43.670" ttm:agent="v1">Oh-oh, ooh-whoa, ooh-whoa</p>

      <p begin="02:43.670" end="02:45.860" ttm:agent="v1">Oh-oh, ooh-whoa</p>

      <p begin="02:45.860" end="02:47.650" ttm:agent="v1">덩기덕 쿵더러러 (얼쑤)</p>

      <p begin="02:47.650" end="02:50.730" ttm:agent="v1">I'm so fine wherever I go (go, go, go, go)</p>

      <p begin="02:50.730" end="02:54.550" ttm:agent="v1">가끔 멀리 돌아가도, oh</p>

      <p begin="02:54.550" end="02:59.240" ttm:agent="v1">It's okay, I'm in love with my-myself</p>

      <p begin="02:59.240" end="03:04.400" ttm:agent="v1">It's okay, 난 이 순간 행복해 (ow!)</p>

